{"id":"c1865e5d-f9d9-45cd-a021-1b44e00b62f5","object":"chat.completion","created":1784884558,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"import math\\n\\ndef solve(case):\\n    matrix = case['matrix']\\n    if not isinstance(matrix, list) or len(matrix) == 0:\\n        raise ValueError('Matrix must be a non-empty list')\\n    n_rows = len(matrix)\\n    if not all(isinstance(row, list) for row in matrix):\\n        raise ValueError('Each row must be a list')\\n    n_cols = len(matrix[0])\\n    if n_cols == 0:\\n        raise ValueError('Matrix must have at least one column')\\n    for row in matrix:\\n        if len(row) != n_cols:\\n            raise ValueError('Inconsistent column count')\\n    # document frequency per column\\n    df = [0] * n_cols\\n    for row in matrix:\\n        for j, val in enumerate(row):\\n            if val != 0:\\n                df[j] += 1\\n    # IDF as floats (natural log)\\n    idf_float = [math.log(1.0 + n_rows / (1.0 + d)) for d in df]\\n    # weighted matrix (unrounded)\\n    weighted_matrix_float = []\\n    for row in matrix:\\n        weighted_row = [row[j] * idf_float[j] for j in range(n_cols)]\\n        weighted_matrix_float.append(weighted_row)\\n    # row degree (unrounded)\\n    row_degree_float = [sum(row) for row in weighted_matrix_float]\\n    # round to 6 decimal places\\n    idf = [round(v, 6) for v in idf_float]\\n    weighted_matrix = [[round(v, 6) for v in row] for row in weighted_matrix_float]\\n    row_degree = [round(v, 6) for v in row_degree_float]\\n    return {\\n        'idf': idf,\\n        'weighted_matrix': weighted_matrix,\\n        'row_degree': row_degree\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) that takes a payload with a \"matrix\" field (list of lists of integers, presumably 0/1 but maybe others). The task: \"Apply the registered sparse IDF scaling, row normalization, self-similarity removal, and degr